  "description": "Spark, Grove and Pattern each document mintUSDS as vault.draw and burnUSDS as vault.wipe against a Sky Allocation Vault. Read that way the entire Liquidity Layer decodes as a lending agreement express",
  "orientation": "Spark, Grove and Pattern each document mintUSDS as vault.draw and burnUSDS as vault.wipe against a Sky Allocation Vault. Read that way the entire Liquidity Layer decodes as a lending agreement expressed in contract roles: the mint rate limit is a credit limit, the 90% Encumbrance Ratio is a leverage covenant, the Freezer is a lender's acceleration right, and Sky holding DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE is the creditor retaining control of the facility. It also explains why emergency wind-down terminates in debt repayment rather than in funds secured.",
